<title>ZAMBIA: Fire guts Zambian vice president's office.</title>
<headline>Fire guts Zambian vice president's office.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>An overnight fire gutted part of a Zambian government building housing the office of Vice President Godfrey Miyanda, police said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The fire extensively damaged the first floor of the building.</p>
<p>The statement said the cause of the blaze was unknown and it gave no further details.</p>
</text>
